Independent project
-------------------
21 Remote is an independent project for remote control of D21m frames. It is
not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by the maker of the D21m. All
pictures, texts and program code of 21 Remote are its own. The serial protocol
and file formats are implemented for interoperability with that equipment.

