Third-party software
--------------------
The AU and VST3 plug-ins are built with:

- JUCE 8 (https://juce.com), used under the GNU Affero General Public
  License v3. JUCE is fetched from https://github.com/juce-framework/JUCE when
  the plug-ins are built and is not part of this repository.
- The VST 3 SDK of Steinberg Media Technologies GmbH, as included in JUCE,
  under its open-source licence (GPLv3 for the version included in JUCE 8.0.4;
  MIT from VST 3.8).

The app itself (engine, window, web interface) and the JS plug-ins use no
third-party libraries. The pictures in web/img are drawn by tools/art/cards.py.
